{"sourceUrl":"https://riis.sufe.edu.cn/jxChinese/b5/13/c10362a242963/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:23.176990+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://riis.sufe.edu.cn/jxChinese/b5/13/c10362a242963/page.htm","html":"<div><p></p><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://riis.sufe.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/9f/f6/668df1324602805384e5b3e255de/af226cff-595a-498b-a77c-7005ca320cae.png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://riis.sufe.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/9f/f6/668df1324602805384e5b3e255de/e09988cb-fcd0-4915-8508-83ad1d3c6ccf.gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>交叉科学研究院简介</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong>Research Institute for Interdisciplinary Sciences</strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://riis.sufe.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/9f/f6/668df1324602805384e5b3e255de/af226cff-595a-498b-a77c-7005ca320cae.png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://riis.sufe.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/9f/f6/668df1324602805384e5b3e255de/9a784317-adcf-4e87-ae80-66731e33a6a4.png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>上海财经大学交叉科学研究院（以下简称“X院”）是上海财经大学为了探索数据与人工智能、数学优化算法理论等方法论，并与经济、管理、金融、制造、供应链、能源、交通等行业的交叉融合、学以致用，而成立的前沿探索学术机构。</span></p><p><span>X院始终坚持与国际顶级科研机构对接，在对科学前沿有着重要意义的问题研究上保持国际水准；学以致用，服务社会，帮助政府和企业解决具有重大影响力的管理与决策问题；培养具有学术理想，探索精神和使命感的本科生和博士，以及具有独立解决复杂现实问题和强动手能力的复合型人才；致力于打造真正的国内外科研信息交汇的中枢与具有广泛影响力的精英之地。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://riis.sufe.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/9f/f6/668df1324602805384e5b3e255de/48a679fa-2cdd-4e8a-8c3f-ea8d929e4966.jpg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>冯诺依曼奖获得者、美国工程院院士、斯坦福大学Veinott教授为学院捐赠的图书，学院借此成立了国内唯一的运筹学图书馆。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://riis.sufe.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/9f/f6/668df1324602805384e5b3e255de/af226cff-595a-498b-a77c-7005ca320cae.png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>X院师资团队由毕业于海内外名校的多位优秀教授组成。</span></p><p><span>在优化、运筹与管理、机器学习、理论计算机等多个领域的国际最顶级期刊与会议（如OR、MOR、MS、MP、FOCS、SODA、EC、ICML、NeurIPS等）有大量论文发表，获得过国家自然科学基金优秀青年科学基金、重大项目等多个重要项目资助和教育部青年长江学者等其他多项高端人才计划。</span></p><p><span>X院与斯坦福大学、芝加哥大学、乔治亚理工学院、纽约大学、英属哥伦比亚大学、新加坡国立大学等高校多名教授有着紧密的科研合作和学生交流及培养合作。2025年5月“凸分析之父”、冯·诺伊曼理论奖得主R. Tyrrell Rockafellar教授、冯·诺伊曼理论奖得主叶荫宇教授等国内外运筹优化领域的顶尖学者和专家受邀来访，共同探讨数据驱动时代下的运筹优化理论最新进展，推动学科交叉与应用。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://riis.sufe.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/9f/f6/668df1324602805384e5b3e255de/af226cff-595a-498b-a77c-7005ca320cae.png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>近年来，学院多名博士生在顶级期刊和会议发表论文，包括：管理学UTD期刊OR、POM、运筹学顶级期刊MOR、人工智能顶级会议NeurIPS、ICML、AAAI等。2022年，X院在读博士生何畅、姜云天的论文被选为NeurIPS HOO Workshop会议的六篇Spotlight Paper之一；2023年，X院硕博连读生张南茜、浦善文分别获POMS、CSAMSE最佳论文奖三等奖；2024年，X院硕博连读生黄晨宇获全国供应链与运营管理学术年会最佳会议论文奖-优秀奖。</span></p><p><span>学院首届硕博连读毕业生张南茜（2018级）赴加拿大毅伟商学院（Ivey School of Business）担任助理教授，是我校历史上首例本土培养博士生获海外一流大学教职，标志着我院在博士生人才培养质量的进一步提升。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://riis.sufe.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/9f/f6/668df1324602805384e5b3e255de/73681f3b-09cc-4b89-af03-bb60071abfdc.png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>一、招生项目</strong></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>我院按管理科学与工程一级学科招生，各研究方向统一培养，仅招收直接攻博与硕博连读项目，招生专业与研究方向详见下表。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://riis.sufe.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/9f/f6/668df1324602805384e5b3e255de/e5130805-b8f5-4ab5-89a2-1d63172f6462.png\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>我院直接攻博与硕博连读项目基本修业年限5年，其中直接攻博项目学生直接取得博士生入学资格，入学后可享受博士生奖助学金；硕博连读项目学生硕士阶段可享受硕博连读硕士阶段津贴。申请我院直接攻博和硕博连读项目的同学将统一选拔、统一考核，根据招生计划、申请人志愿及复试成绩择优给予直接攻博名额。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://riis.sufe.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/9f/f6/668df1324602805384e5b3e255de/73681f3b-09cc-4b89-af03-bb60071abfdc.png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://riis.sufe.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/9f/f6/668df1324602805384e5b3e255de/af226cff-595a-498b-a77c-7005ca320cae.png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>二、申请条件</strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><ol><li><p><span>全国具有推免资格的普通高等学校本科三年级在校学生（2026届毕业生），不限专业，要求具备良好的数理、经济和管理学基础。</span></p></li><li><p><span>“双一流”建设高校，专业成绩或综合成绩在所学专业名列前茅；或其他高校专业成绩或综合成绩在所学专业名列前10%。</span></p></li><li><p><span>英语成绩优秀。</span></p></li><li><p><span>申请人应对本学院所对应专业的学术研究有浓厚兴趣，愿意并有能力从事学术研究工作。</span></p></li><li><p><span>符合《上海财经大学接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生工作管理办法（2020年9月修订）》（上财行规﹝2021﹞25号）规定的推免生申请条件。</span></p></li></ol></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://riis.sufe.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/9f/f6/668df1324602805384e5b3e255de/545194ad-a87a-41a4-991c-fc9f05c9a2ac.png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://riis.sufe.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/9f/f6/668df1324602805384e5b3e255de/73681f3b-09cc-4b89-af03-bb60071abfdc.png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://riis.sufe.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/9f/f6/668df1324602805384e5b3e255de/af226cff-595a-498b-a77c-7005ca320cae.png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>三、申请流程</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>申请人通过“上海财经大学研究生报考服务系统”（https://yz.sufe.edu.cn/ks/）填写申请信息并按照下述“四、申请材料”中的要求提交材料附件。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://riis.sufe.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/9f/f6/668df1324602805384e5b3e255de/d6be1dec-c9dc-4437-890b-9fffdf5453a0.png\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>申请时间：</span></p><p><strong><span><span>7 月 1 日 9 时至 8 月 20 日 24 时</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><em><strong>本年度已注册我校“全国优秀大学生夏令营”项目的申请人，可直接使用该项目用户名和密码进行登录，招生项目须选择“全国优秀大学生推免生预报名”。</strong></em></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://riis.sufe.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/9f/f6/668df1324602805384e5b3e255de/af226cff-595a-498b-a77c-7005ca320cae.png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>四、申请材料</span></span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>（申请人须完整提交以下材料至报名系统）</strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>01</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>考生申请表PDF彩色扫描件</strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><p><span>从报名系统下载，考生签署、所在学院负责人签字加盖公章后扫描；</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>02</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>个人陈述PDF彩色扫描件</strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><p><span>从报名系统下载，考生填写打印签字后扫描；</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>03</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>专家推荐信</strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><p><span>专家推荐信 2 封PDF彩色扫描件，需要2位副教授（含）以上老师分别推荐（考生填写报名信息时，在推荐人信息维护界面填写、保存并下载，专家填写签字后扫描）；</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>04</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>本科阶段成绩单</strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><p><span>PDF彩色扫描件（由所在学校教务部门提供并加盖公章）；</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>05</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>排名证明</strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><p><span>前五个学期总评成绩专业或年级排名证明PDF彩色扫描件（从报名系统下载，由所在学校教务部门或学院填写加盖公章后扫描）；</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>06</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>英语成绩证明</strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><p><span>国家大学英语六级考试成绩等材料PDF彩色扫描件；</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>07</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>身份证PDF彩色扫描件</strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><p><span>正反面需在一页上，身份证在有效期内；</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>08</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>学生证PDF彩色扫描件</strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><p><span>包含照片及个人信息页；</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>09</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>学籍在线验证报告</strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>《教育部学籍在线验证报告》PDF版；</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>10</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>个人诚信承诺书</strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><p><span>PDF彩色扫描件（从报名系统下载，填写打印签字后扫描），承诺书未提交的申请者，将视为申请材料无效；</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>11</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>其他证明材料</strong></p></section></section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><p><span>如已发表论文及各类奖状及证书等PDF彩色扫描件。</span></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong>特别提醒：未能在预报名截止时间前按要求上传上述材料者，其网上预报名无效。各类证件和证明文件要求彩色版扫描件。对不符合规定或弄虚作假者，一经核实，将取消录取资格，并通报所在院校。对于扫描不清晰材料，以及格式不符合以上要求的材料，将视作无效材料处理，不接受其报名。</strong></p></section></section><section><p><span><em><strong>本年度申请人在我校“全国优秀大学生夏令营”项目中所填写的信息与上传的相关材料将自动同步到“全国优秀大学生推免生预报名”账户中，提交状态显示为未提交，申请人需复核完善相关信息和材料后，点击“确认并提交”按钮进行提交。</strong></em></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://riis.sufe.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/9f/f6/668df1324602805384e5b3e255de/73f59777-d5ce-4cee-9e7d-93b34e71c426.png\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://riis.sufe.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/9f/f6/668df1324602805384e5b3e255de/73f59777-d5ce-4cee-9e7d-93b34e71c426.png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://riis.sufe.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/9f/f6/668df1324602805384e5b3e255de/e2f51c60-4713-4232-a8e0-3cf09095dfa0.png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://riis.sufe.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/9f/f6/668df1324602805384e5b3e255de/73681f3b-09cc-4b89-af03-bb60071abfdc.png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://riis.sufe.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/9f/f6/668df1324602805384e5b3e255de/af226cff-595a-498b-a77c-7005ca320cae.png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>五、资格审定</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>交叉科学研究院研究生招生工作领导小组将组织对申请材料进行评审，择优确定考核名单，并组织复试考核。本次预推免复试考核预计将在</span><strong><span><span> 9 月</span></span></strong><span>进行，具体时间等待学院进一步通知。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>六、推免生录取</strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>所有通过我校推免生复试考核，获得我校推免候选人资格的推免生均须在规定时间内登录“教育部全国推免服务系统”报考我校，接收并确认相关学院的“复试通知”与“待录取通知”。推免服务系统开放时间请关注中国研究生招生信息网相关公告。</span></p><p><span>在规定时间内未确认接受我校发放的“复试通知”与“待录取通知”，将无法获得我校接收推免生录取资格。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://riis.sufe.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/9f/f6/668df1324602805384e5b3e255de/af226cff-595a-498b-a77c-7005ca320cae.png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong>七、其他事项</strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>未获得所在高校推荐资格或不符合《上海财经大学接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生工作管理办法（2020年9月修订）》相关规定，即使通过我校预报名考核，仍无法获得我校接收推免生录取资格。</span></p><p><span>本通知内容与教育主管部门日后下达文件不符的，以教育主管部门下达的文件为准。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>八、联系方式</strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>联系人：杨老师</span></p><p><span>联系电话：021-65900544</span></p><p><span>联系邮箱：rcmsia@msg.shufe.edu.cn</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>扫码关注</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong>FOLLOW__QR CODE</strong></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://riis.sufe.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/9f/f6/668df1324602805384e5b3e255de/af226cff-595a-498b-a77c-7005ca320cae.png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://riis.sufe.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/9f/f6/668df1324602805384e5b3e255de/9a784317-adcf-4e87-ae80-66731e33a6a4.png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://riis.sufe.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/9f/f6/668df1324602805384e5b3e255de/7781dd2e-2aa6-4142-bb4b-83c5a8be6399.png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://riis.sufe.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/9f/f6/668df1324602805384e5b3e255de/b97e9fd4-9116-44ae-881c-1bff79699b49.jpg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong>微信号｜</strong></span><span>SUFE_RIIS</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://riis.sufe.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/9f/f6/668df1324602805384e5b3e255de/f8b201db-d92a-439a-9898-98e305108652.png\"/></section></section></section><p></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"f623cbc53a007b89bc24737b1936fb7756c874c305c8330ea4139df61452dfe6","textLength":2893,"sourceSha256":"0fbde74059ef145f616c1de2659ccbe0e13c29601b784393ea82ff23a941a2a3","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-70eb2d4aa4aa514f1fe2","title":"2025年上海财经大学交叉科学研究院2026年接收推荐免试研究生（含直博生）预推免报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:23.176990+00:00"}
